# Deny by default: local credentials, caches, reports and repositories stay out.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!arbalest_cli.py
!mcp_server.py
!engine/
!engine/**/
!engine/**/*.py
# Defense in depth if the allowlist is expanded later.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.git
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/credentials*
**/secrets*
